{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SnoozeBuster 是一款以互動挑戰取代一按即停的鬧鐘，專為總是按下貪睡鍵、起床後匆匆忙忙的用戶而設。它要求你完成指定任務，鬧鐘才會關閉，令賴床幾乎不可能。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>三種起床挑戰模式</h2>\n<p>SnoozeBuster 內置三種起床挑戰：Wake Circles 要長按螢幕上移動的圓圈；Quick Math 需解答簡單數學題，喚醒仍半睡的大腦；Barcode Scan 則要求掃描預先設定的條碼，迫使你離開床鋪才能關掉鬧鐘。鬧鐘只儲存於裝置上，毋須註冊帳戶或訂閱，適合想建立穩定早晨習慣的用戶。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-118-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-119-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-120-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-121-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1242x2688bb-122-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SnoozeBuster – Alarm Clock</li>\n<li>應用類別：Utilities</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-08T12:19:35.248037+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":323,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}